  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Neil Sutton is an Australian businessman from the family behind Sydney's Suttons Motors. He inherited a share of the dealership business from his father, Sir Frederick Sutton, and later sold it. He directed the proceeds into a family trust, building a portfolio of property and business investments beyond the original car trade.",
